Privacy Policy for Magic42 Lottery
Last Updated: 03/07/2026
At Magic42 Lottery, we take your privacy seriously. This policy explains how we handle your data within the application.
1. Data Collection and Usage
•
Personalization Data (D.O.B & TimeZone): The app asks for your Date of Birth, Birth Hour, and Time Zone. This data is used strictly locally on your device to calibrate the HGTG-42 Random Number Generator.
◦
We do not upload, store, or share your birth details on any servers.
•
Lottery History: Any combinations you generate are stored in a local database on your device. You have full control over this data and can delete it at any time via the "Clear History" button in Settings.
•
Financial Data: We do not collect or store your payment information. All In-App Purchases are handled securely by the Google Play Billing System.
2. Permissions
•
Internet Access: Used to fetch the latest historical lottery results from public sources to ensure your "System" generations remain unique and statistically relevant.
•
Storage: Used only to save your generated history and preferences locally on your device.
3. Third-Party Services
The app uses the following third-party services that may collect data:
•
Google Play Services: For app stability and licensing.
•
Google Play Billing: For processing premium version upgrades.
4. Responsible Play
We provide a "Weekly Budget" feature to help users manage their spending. This feature is local to the device and is intended to promote healthy gaming habits. We do not track your actual real-world lottery spending.
5. Data Deletion
Since all your data (History, DOB, Preferences) is stored locally, deleting the application or using the "Clear History" function in Settings will permanently remove all data associated with the app from your device.
